{"nodes": [{"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_constituicao_constituicao", "label": "Constitui\u00e7\u00e3o \u2014 princ\u00edpios que a m\u00e1quina verifica", "file_type": "document", "rationale": "A constitui\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o \u00e9 estilo, \u00e9 lei: todo princ\u00edpio [DEVE] precisa de verifica\u00e7\u00e3o execut\u00e1vel, sen\u00e3o o audit acusa PRINCIPIO_SEM_VERIFICACAO.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/constituicao.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_constituicao_niveis_de_obrigacao", "label": "N\u00edveis de obriga\u00e7\u00e3o [DEVE]/[RECOMENDADO]/[PODE]", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "N\u00edvel fora da lista vira NIVEL_INVALIDO e o princ\u00edpio \u00e9 tratado como DEVE \u2014 nunca ignorado em sil\u00eancio, para que um typo n\u00e3o afrouxe o gate.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/constituicao.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_constituicao_formas_de_verificacao", "label": "Quatro formas de verifica\u00e7\u00e3o de princ\u00edpio", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "verifica\u00e7\u00e3o(gate) s\u00f3 para princ\u00edpios meta sobre o processo; verifica\u00e7\u00e3o(teste) exige @principle:P-xxx passando; verifica\u00e7\u00e3o(proibido) e verifica\u00e7\u00e3o(obrigat\u00f3rio) fazem grep de regex em glob. Regex roda em subprocesso com timeout de 5s para que backtracking catastr\u00f3fico vire VERIFICACAO_MALFORMADA em vez de travar o gate.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/constituicao.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_constituicao_preset_lgpd_educacao", "label": "Preset LGPD + educa\u00e7\u00e3o", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Princ\u00edpios reais (P-001 a P-008) para produtos que guardam dados de alunos, inclusive menores. Os globs/regex precisam ser ajustados \u00e0 stack porque rodam de verdade no audit; glob que n\u00e3o casa nada vira GLOB_SEM_ARQUIVOS (verifica\u00e7\u00e3o inerte, prov\u00e1vel typo).", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/constituicao.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_constituicao_rastreabilidade_principio_arquivo_linha", "label": "Rastreabilidade princ\u00edpio \u2192 arquivo \u2192 linha", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Um estudo de caso de microsservi\u00e7os banc\u00e1rios relatou 73% menos defeitos de seguran\u00e7a quando os princ\u00edpios eram rastreados at\u00e9 arquivo e linha; por isso cada viola\u00e7\u00e3o sai com arquivo:linha em vez de 'reveja o c\u00f3digo'.", "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/constituicao.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_constituicao_constituicao", "target": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_constituicao_niveis_de_obrigacao", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/constituicao.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_constituicao_constituicao", "target": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_constituicao_formas_de_verificacao", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": ".agents/skills/onp-spec-driven/references/constituicao.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "_agents_skills_onp_spec_driven_references_constituicao_